# Template for ~/.i3_local, which config/i3/config includes if it exists.
#
# Put host-specific i3 directives here — things that must not be committed.
# Monitor layouts are managed by `i3-monitors` (config/i3/monitors/*.sh) and
# must NOT be set here; use `i3-monitors office|home|laptop` instead.
#
#   cp config/i3/config.local.example ~/.i3_local
